{"id": "mm5121a2", "status": "invalid", "message_id": "msg_011CggGVjNCQ45713t3ECbzG", "model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "errors": ["quote not found in the article: The age-adjusted prevalence of self-reported HBP increased s…"], "usage": {"input": 11929, "output": 3420}, "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"text": "{\"id\": \"mm5121a2\", \"data_focus\": {\"v\": \"yes\", \"ev\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"CDC analyzed BRFSS data from 1991, 1993, 1995, 1997, and 1999 for persons from the 50 states and the District of Columbia\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"The age-adjusted prevalence of self-reported HBP increased significantly from 22.9% in 1991 to 24.9% in 1999\"}]}, \"outcome_types\": [{\"v\": \"binary/categorical\", \"ev\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"remained relatively constant at 95.3% in 1991 and 94.5% in 1999\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"increased significantly from 22.9% in 1991 to 24.9% in 1999\"}]}], \"analytic_depth\": [{\"v\": \"summary\", \"ev\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"In 1999, age-adjusted prevalence of self-reported HBP ranged from 14.0% in Arizona to 31.6% in Alabama\"}]}, {\"v\": \"comparison\", \"ev\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Recent BP screening declined significantly among persons aged 20--44 years and those aged 45--64 years\"}]}, {\"v\": \"stratified/adjusted\", \"ev\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"In 1991 and 1999, age-adjusted prevalences of recent BP screening were higher among non-Hispanic blacks\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Prevalences were age-adjusted to the 2000 U.S. standard population.\"}]}], \"study_design\": [{\"v\": \"cross-sectional\", \"ev\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"BRFSS is a state-based, random-digit--dialed telephone survey of the civilian, noninstitutionalized U.S. population\"}]}, {\"v\": \"before/after or trend\", \"ev\": [{\"loc\": \"summary\", \"q\": \"This report summarizes data from the Behavioral Risk Factor Surveillance System (BRFSS) on state-specific trends\"}]}], \"methods_quotes\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Data were weighted and analyzed using SUDAAN (version 7.0) to account for the complex sampling design in each state\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Prevalences were age-adjusted to the 2000 U.S. standard population.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"The state-specific percentage point differences between 1991 and 1999 for recent BP screening and HBP were limited to DC and the 47 states\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}